    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18101" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφαιρ-ετέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must take away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				361a
			</span></i>; <i>one must exclude,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				291c
			</span></i>; <i>one must take away in thought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφαιρετέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έα</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έον</span>,</span>
			<i>to be taken away, removed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				398e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				8.249d
			</span></i>.</div>
